libdatachannel v0.24.5: retain an application ICE resource through agent retirement

NereusSDR Core-only patch applied after the shared 0003 ICE retirement patch.
MPL-2.0, like the covered files it changes. Task 56, 2026-09-27.

An optional Configuration owner keeps a Core UDP candidate route alive until
the closing libjuice agent actually destroys its socket. The retirement
continuation releases the agent, then the owner, then its Init token. The
public field is null by default and contains no Core or Qt implementation.

